---
title: "build_pipeline (docker-compose.yml + Dockerfile: multi-stage build)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_builder_init: FROM node 20-alpine AS builder
    q_builder_init --> q_copy_deps: COPY package*.json
    q_copy_deps --> q_install_all: npm ci (all dependencies)
    q_install_all --> q_copy_src: COPY source code
    q_copy_src --> q_ts_build: npm run build (TypeScript)
    q_ts_build --> q_prod_init: FROM node 20-alpine (production)
    q_ts_build --> q_build_fail: build error
    q_build_fail --> [*]: build aborted

    q_prod_init --> q_prod_deps: npm ci --only=production
    q_prod_deps --> q_copy_dist: COPY dist from builder
    q_copy_dist --> q_expose: EXPOSE 3000
    q_expose --> q_cmd: CMD npm start
    q_cmd --> [*]: image ready

    note right of q_install_all
        INV-001: npm ci uses lockfile for deterministic install
        INV-002: builder stage includes devDependencies for TypeScript compilation
    end note

    note right of q_prod_deps
        INV-003: production stage excludes devDependencies
        INV-004: only dist/ artifacts copied from builder (no source code in production image)
    end note

    note right of q_expose
        INV-005: container listens on port 3000
    end note
